<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 34.5.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 34.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 35,000 shares in Farm Food SA at 34.5 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Farm Food traded at 39.2 zlotys in 18,105 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
